  "rules": [
    "Dual-anchor market regime + M2 breadth-thrust recovery overlay routes OFFENSIVE 85% / STRUCTURAL 60% / RECOVERY 40% (10d icepoint pct60<15% & pct20<15%, thrust pct20>=45% or +30pp/5d with pct20>=40% and amount>=1.15x; stops back on 5d-low break) / DEFENSIVE 15% (EXP-V3-08 7 triggers, 0 false breakouts).",
    "Base super-ETF chassis reserves 30% permanent LOW_VOL core (159549.SZ/159207.SZ) across OFFENSIVE/STRUCTURAL/RECOVERY and 100% of DEFENSIVE equity, cutting bear-market drawdown without monthly ERC refitting churn (EXP-V3-07 R1).",
    "Idle defensive weight deploys via low-ticket bond reservoir priority (159649.SZ -> 511260.SH -> 511010.SH) with 10% periodic drift band and >=5,000 CNY minimum active buy ticket (EXP-V3-06 D1).",
    "Super Sector ETF pioneer enables 20 industry_theme Super ETFs ranked by 0.5*ret20 + 0.5*ret60 above MA60 (top-1, <=20% weight). Mainboard BP1_PULLBACK stocks open only when investable NAV >= 100,000 CNY and not in active deconcentration.",
    "Every stock pioneer trade requires QualityCore (ROE>5%, EPS>0, OCF/Profit>50% with PIT ann_date<=T) and a -8% hard stop; reaching +15% gain only raises the stop to breakeven (cost), while a close below MA20 exits at the next session unconditionally, with no +15% arming prerequisite (EXP-V3-02 rule, owner amendment 2026-11-24).",
    "Concentrated sector ETF uses BOTTOM_GRIND_25 (keep 25% strategic core, drop low-level monthly forced selling, 2-day support floor breakdown confirm, plus +10% guarded reload only when MA60_slope10>=0, >=7% discount, oversold washout, and right-side close>MA5; >=34% drift stall harvest; EXP-V3-04 15/0 RT win rate).",
    "TWO_STAGE_GRADUAL drawdown control caps risk equity at 50% (-8% work DD) / 25% (-11% work DD) / 10d lock (-13.5% work DD, 0% concentrated / 10% normal) then re-anchors work peak with 10d ramp while keeping all-time true_peak strictly un-reanchored."
